{"content":[{"c":["ZABDI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Zerah’s descendant from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.7.1","r":"Josh.7.1","rawR":"Josh.7.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.7.1","value":"Josh.7.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 7:1"},"). Achan was a Zerahite of the family of Zabdi (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.7.17-18","r":"Josh.7.17-18","rawR":"Josh.7.17-18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.7.17-18","value":"Josh.7.17-18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 7:17-18"},"); alternately called Zimri (",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," mg, ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.6","r":"1Chr.2.6","rawR":"1Chr.2.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.6","value":"1Chr.2.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Shimei’s son and a descendant of Ehud from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.19","r":"1Chr.8.19","rawR":"1Chr.8.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.19","value":"1Chr.8.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. David’s officer over the produce of the vineyards for the wine cellars (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.27","r":"1Chr.27.27","rawR":"1Chr.27.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.27","value":"1Chr.27.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:27"},"). He is called a Shiphmite, which likely means that he was a native of Shepham."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of the temple musicians of the order of Asaph (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.17","r":"Neh.11.17","rawR":"Neh.11.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.17","value":"Neh.11.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:17"},"); alternately called Zicri (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.15","r":"1Chr.9.15","rawR":"1Chr.9.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.15","value":"1Chr.9.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zabdi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 7:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_works